   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Having done something before",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about an experience, **-(으)ㄴ 적이 있어요** is used (I have… before). The verb is put in the past form before **적이**: 가다 → **간 적이 있어요** (I've gone before), 먹다 → **먹은 적이 있어요** (I've eaten before).",
      "한국에 **간 적이** 있어요 = I've been to Korea before."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Never",
     "texto": [
      "To say you have never done it, change **있어요** to **없어요**: 먹은 적이 **없어요** = I've never eaten. With **한 번도** (not once) it is reinforced: 한 번도 간 적이 없어요 = I've never been."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
